{"q":{"g":"In this quest you have to kill 10 Scavs in the underground warehouse and the ramps leading down to it on Reserve. The wanted warehouse is located in the northwest and marked with \"Д\". Getting tagged and cursed on purpose can help with getting Scavs in the quest area.","sh":[{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/5/54/Reserv_guide.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230624234929","c":"Warehouse \"Д\" marked on map"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/4/41/ReserveQuestWarehouse.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20251107232525","c":"Warehouse \"Д\" gates"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/e/e2/Safe_corridor.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20250225134933","c":"Inside the warehouse"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/6/66/Safe_corridor_map.png/revision/latest?cb=20260404131701","c":"Kill area marked on map"}]},"o":{},"x":{}}